  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Do I need prior experience to join Inovate Institute of Technology?",
      "a": "Most of our beginner tracks need zero prior coding experience—just dedication and analytical curiosity. Intermediate and advanced tracks clearly detail prerequisites on their course cards."
    },
    {
      "q": "How does Inovate Solution Technology connect with the Academy?",
      "a": "Inovate Institute of Technology is the dedicated skilling and training division of Inovate Solution Technology—a full-spectrum software engineering and IT consulting firm based in Madurai. You learn through real engineering workflows and actual client project patterns."
    },
    {
      "q": "Will I get a verified course completion certificate?",
      "a": "Yes. Every learner who completes their course milestones and final capstone project receives an official certificate of completion from Inovate Solution Technology."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I miss a scheduled live class?",
      "a": "All live interactive sessions are recorded and archived with code references and notes so you can catch up anytime throughout your program."
    },
    {
      "q": "How is mentorship structured during the courses?",
      "a": "You receive direct 1-on-1 code reviews and milestone check-ins with active software developers and mentors from Inovate Solution Technology."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can colleges and companies partner with IST for group training?",
      "a": "Yes. Inovate Solution Technology actively conducts college collaborations, faculty development programmes, student workshops, and corporate team upskilling across Tamil Nadu and online."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are weekend batches available for working professionals?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer both dedicated weekend batches and flexible evening slots specifically designed for working professionals and university students."
    }
  ],
