  "story": [
    "Inovate Solution Technology (IST) is an IT consulting, custom software development, and digital solutions firm based in Madurai, Tamil Nadu. Having built production platforms—including LMS platforms, Campus Drive Evaluation systems (istems.online), and enterprise applications—we observed the widening gap between traditional academic syllabi and modern engineering reality.",
    "To bridge this divide, we established Inovate Institute of Technology as our dedicated skilling division. We designed the curriculum around a single conviction: the fastest path to technical mastery is working on real briefs, receiving code-level critique from practicing engineers, and deploying working software to production.",
    "Today, Inovate Solution Technology unites software products, technical services, and academic collaborations. We run industry internships, university workshops, and career tracks that equip learners with genuine engineering capabilities—from Madurai to the global tech ecosystem."
  ],
